## Step-8 
Android internet permission
Open this:
android/app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml
Add this code:
<uses-permission android:name="android.permission.INTERNET"/>

If this is local HTTP development, we can also ensure the app permits cleartext traffic.

Go Inside <application> and use this:
android:usesCleartextTraffic="true"

## The Main XML Code
<application
    android:label="1Fi Marketplace"
    android:name="${applicationName}"
    android:icon="@mipmap/ic_launcher"
    android:usesCleartextTraffic="true">

Important part if this is for HTTPS use we will use this for production, use HTTPS instead.
